  "html": "<h1 data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Longhorn Steakhouse Menu: Access Denied? Here&#8217;s Full Permission to Access the Server of Flavor</h1>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2358\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2358\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2358\" src=\"/img/wp/e068e9a4d1-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm.webp\" alt=\"A hearty spread of Longhorn Steakhouse dishes, including a perfectly grilled steak, shrimp skewers, loaded baked potato, corn, chicken, and a fresh salad, with a &quot;Full Server Access Granted&quot; overlay.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/e068e9a4d1-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm.webp 1024w, /img/wp/b76b3621e1-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/6931359910-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/4ad31d62f9-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-7.webp 768w, /img/wp/d629279f57-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-5.webp 500w, /img/wp/cad678ed4f-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2358\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Explore the full Longhorn Steakhouse menu with this comprehensive guide, featuring all your favorite grilled meats and savory dishes, overcoming any &#8220;access denied&#8221; messages.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Longhorn Steakhouse has long been recognized as one of America’s go-to destinations for premium grilled meats, perfectly cooked steaks, and a bold atmosphere inspired by the Western saloon experience. For those searching for the ultimate menu experience at Longhorn, this guide will walk you through every dish, combo, and mouth-watering meal you can expect to find at a Longhorn Steakhouse location.</p><p>This comprehensive breakdown of the Longhorn Steakhouse menu includes details on steaks, chicken, seafood, burgers, sandwiches, appetizers, salads, sides, drinks, desserts, seasonal specials, and more. Whether you&#8217;re looking to understand the food menu before a visit, or just love reading about grilled to perfection meats and flavorful meals, this content will satisfy your appetite for information.</p>\n<div>\n<hr />\n</div>\n<h2>Longhorn Steakhouse: The Bold Taste of the West</h2>\n<p>From the moment you walk into a Longhorn Steakhouse, you&#8217;re greeted by an inviting saloon-style ambiance, western-themed decor, and the irresistible scent of sizzling beef and pork. It&#8217;s more than just a place to eat – it&#8217;s a full-flavored experience.</p>\n<p>Longhorn prides itself on offering expertly grilled meats, classic American comfort food, and seasonal favorites that rotate throughout the year.</p>\n<h3>Why the &#8220;Access Denied&#8221; Confusion?</h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2360\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2360\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2360\" src=\"/img/wp/a9478fd6c1-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-2.webp\" alt=\"A smartphone displaying an &quot;Access Denied&quot; message for a Longhorn Steakhouse menu, contrasted with a hand opening a physical menu showing &quot;Full Access Granted&quot; on a restaurant table\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/a9478fd6c1-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-2.webp 1024w, /img/wp/127c891935-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-2.webp 300w, /img/wp/4a5092c257-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-2.webp 150w, /img/wp/6fe99a3ad8-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-2.webp 768w, /img/wp/7325c39435-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-2.webp 500w, /img/wp/9feeae668d-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-2.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2360\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Understand why you might encounter &#8220;access denied&#8221; messages online and discover where to get full permission to access the complete Longhorn Steakhouse menu with ease.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Some guests searching for the Longhorn Steakhouse menu online may encounter an &#8220;access denied&#8221; message. This usually happens due to geo-restrictions or server issues when trying to load the food menu. If you see &#8220;permission to access /longhorn-steakhouse-menu/ on this server is denied,&#8221; don’t worry. You’ll get full access to everything you need here.</p>\n<div>\n<hr />\n</div>\n<h2>Menu Highlights: A Breakdown of Longhorn&#8217;s Food Offerings</h2>\n<p>Let’s explore the Longhorn Steakhouse menu in detailed categories.</p>\n<h3>Appetizer</h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2361\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2361\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2361\" src=\"/img/wp/300db61532-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-3.webp\" alt=\"A spread of Longhorn Steakhouse appetizers: Wild West Shrimp with spicy cherry peppers, a Texas Tonion, and Firecracker Chicken Wraps, ready to be enjoyed.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/300db61532-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-3.webp 1024w, /img/wp/c0d497a334-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/7500b53cea-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-3.webp 150w, /img/wp/6eca44dadf-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-3.webp 768w, /img/wp/e0ad6137f5-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-3.webp 500w, /img/wp/4f642aef9b-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-3.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2361\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Kick off your meal with Longhorn Steakhouse&#8217;s signature appetizers, from crispy Wild West Shrimp to the flavorful Texas Tonion and spicy Firecracker Chicken Wraps.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Start your meal with a savory appetizer to whet your palate. Each item is designed to highlight Longhorn&#8217;s commitment to bold flavor.</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Appetizer Name</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n<th>Price (USD)</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wild West Shrimp</td>\n<td>Crispy, hand-battered shrimp with spicy cherry peppers</td>\n<td>$10.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Texas Tonion</td>\n<td>Crispy onion petals with zesty dipping sauce</td>\n<td>$9.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Firecracker Chicken Wraps</td>\n<td>Spicy chicken, cheese, and peppers in a crispy wrap</td>\n<td>$10.29</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<hr />\n</div>\n<h3>Salad</h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2362\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2362\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2362\" src=\"/img/wp/6416d72a87-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-4.webp\" alt=\"A trio of fresh Longhorn Steakhouse salads: a Grilled Chicken Caesar Salad, a vibrant Strawberry Pecan Salad, and a Farm Fresh Field Greens salad, presented on a rustic wooden table.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/6416d72a87-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-4.webp 1024w, /img/wp/872cf3eb17-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-4.webp 300w, /img/wp/b536644960-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-4.webp 150w, /img/wp/6a89d4ac98-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-4.webp 768w, /img/wp/6779bfde0a-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-4.webp 500w, /img/wp/b49cc56f2b-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-4.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2362\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Savor the fresh, crisp salads at Longhorn Steakhouse, featuring options like the Grilled Chicken Caesar, Strawberry Pecan Salad, and classic Farm Fresh Field Greens.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Every salad at Longhorn is made with fresh, seasonal ingredients and can be served as a side or main dish. Try it with your choice of dressing, such as honey mustard, ranch, or zesty vinaigrette.</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Salad Name</td>\n<td>Dressing Options</td>\n<td>Price (USD)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Farm Fresh Field Greens</td>\n<td>Ranch, Honey Mustard, Vinaigrette</td>\n<td>$5.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grilled Chicken Caesar</td>\n<td>Caesar</td>\n<td>$12.49</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Strawberry Pecan Salad</td>\n<td>Raspberry Vinaigrette</td>\n<td>$13.29</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<hr />\n</div>\n<h3>Steak</h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2363\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2363\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2363\" src=\"/img/wp/86f53ca8e7-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-6.webp\" alt=\"Three perfectly grilled Longhorn Steakhouse steaks: a sliced ribeye on a skillet, a sirloin with butter and a loaded baked potato, and another sirloin with a side salad, showcasing various cuts and preparations.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/86f53ca8e7-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-6.webp 1024w, /img/wp/ca81050eda-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-6.webp 300w, /img/wp/486fbb5c17-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-6.webp 150w, /img/wp/35ff6cee5b-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-6.webp 768w, /img/wp/dd08b714b8-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-6.webp 500w, /img/wp/ead8923bb1-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-6.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2363\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Experience the heart of Longhorn Steakhouse with expertly grilled steaks, from Renegade Sirloin to Outlaw Ribeye and The Longhorn, cooked to your desired perfection.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The heart of the Longhorn Steakhouse lies in its steak offerings – grilled to perfection. Cuts range from 6 oz to 22 oz, and each is hand-seasoned, fire-grilled, and cooked to your liking: medium, rare, or well-done.</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Steak Cut</td>\n<td>Weight</td>\n<td>Price (USD)</td>\n<td>Served With</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Renegade Sirloin</td>\n<td>6 oz / 8 oz</td>\n<td>$13.99 / $15.99</td>\n<td>Choice of side and salad</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Outlaw Ribeye</td>\n<td>20 oz</td>\n<td>$28.49</td>\n<td>Baked potato, salad</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>The Longhorn</td>\n<td>22 oz</td>\n<td>$31.99</td>\n<td>Loaded baked potato, salad</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<hr />\n</div>\n<h3>Chicken</h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2364\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2364\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2364\" src=\"/img/wp/9247ae3953-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-7.webp\" alt=\"A plate featuring Longhorn Steakhouse&#039;s Parmesan Crusted Chicken breasts alongside a basket of crispy Longhorn Chicken Tenders and a serving of golden french fries.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/9247ae3953-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-7.webp 1024w, /img/wp/3ac233f03f-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-7.webp 300w, /img/wp/1f256d42a4-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-7.webp 150w, /img/wp/4fc4dc5d10-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-7.webp 768w, /img/wp/0c14baba95-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-7.webp 500w, /img/wp/c42dafc568-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-7.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2364\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Enjoy the bold Western taste of Longhorn Steakhouse&#8217;s chicken options, including the juicy Parmesan Crusted Chicken and crispy Longhorn Chicken Tenders.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>From juicy grilled to crispy breaded, the chicken options bring bold Western taste to every bite.</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Chicken Dish</td>\n<td>Description</td>\n<td>Price (USD)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Parmesan Crusted Chicken</td>\n<td>Cheese crust, juicy grilled breast</td>\n<td>$14.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Longhorn Chicken Tenders</td>\n<td>Crispy, served with bbq sauce</td>\n<td>$13.49</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<hr />\n</div>\n<h3>Seafood</h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2365\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2365\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2365\" src=\"/img/wp/da0c648064-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-8.webp\" alt=\"Two plates of Longhorn Steakhouse seafood: one with grilled Redrock Shrimp served with rice and vegetables, and another with a perfectly grilled Longhorn Salmon fillet on a bed of spinach.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/da0c648064-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-8.webp 1024w, /img/wp/5737a4d7dd-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-8.webp 300w, /img/wp/56ce815c82-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-8.webp 150w, /img/wp/5538b34c8c-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-8.webp 768w, /img/wp/5eddf0ad1f-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-8.webp 500w, /img/wp/1318f2a16e-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-58pm-8.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2365\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Indulge in Longhorn Steakhouse&#8217;s savory seafood options, featuring the delicious Redrock Grilled Shrimp and expertly seasoned Longhorn Salmon.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>For fans of seafood, Longhorn offers several savory and lightly seasoned dishes.</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Seafood Option</td>\n<td>Description</td>\n<td>Price (USD)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Redrock Grilled Shrimp</td>\n<td>With rice and vegetables</td>\n<td>$16.49</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Longhorn Salmon</td>\n<td>Grilled to perfection, bold spices</td>\n<td>$19.99</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<hr />\n</div>\n<h3>Burgers and Sandwiches</h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2366\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2366\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2366\" src=\"/img/wp/f3d474aa2a-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-59pm.webp\" alt=\"A hearty Steakhouse Burger with bacon, cheddar, onion, and pickles next to a Grilled Chicken Sandwich with bell peppers and tomato, both served with golden fries at Longhorn Steakhouse.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/f3d474aa2a-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-59pm.webp 1024w, /img/wp/3646cf95f6-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-59pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/d1b7b8cdac-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-59pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/ab57b8a508-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-59pm-7.webp 768w, /img/wp/515cfae69a-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-59pm-5.webp 500w, /img/wp/40a136ffc2-generated-image-october-17-2025-1-59pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2366\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Sink your teeth into Longhorn Steakhouse&#8217;s robust burgers and sandwiches, from the classic Steakhouse Burger to the flavorful Grilled Chicken Sandwich, all with crispy fries.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Longhorn Steakhouse&#8217;s burgers and sandwiches are crafted using ground beef, cheddar cheese, crispy toppings, and house-made sauces.</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Burger/Sandwich</td>\n<td>Description</td>\n<td>Price (USD)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Steakhouse Burger</td>\n<td>Bacon, cheddar, onion, pickles</td>\n<td>$13.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grilled Chicken Sandwich</td>\n<td>Bell peppers, tomato, vinaigrette</td>\n<td>$12.49</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<hr />\n</div>\n<h2>Side</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2367\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2367\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2367\" src=\"/img/wp/6837482a3b-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-06pm.webp\" alt=\"A hearty steak dinner with a loaded baked potato, grilled corn on the cob, and crispy seasoned french fries.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/6837482a3b-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-06pm.webp 1024w, /img/wp/5ea35e7003-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-06pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/ddb2416498-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-06pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/0edb5f39f6-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-06pm-7.webp 768w, /img/wp/2aaae35d5d-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-06pm-5.webp 500w, /img/wp/7c513ba325-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-06pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2367\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Elevate your meal with classic and modern side dishes like seasoned French fries, loaded baked potatoes, and sweet corn on the cob.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Sides elevate your meal, offering both classic and modern choices.</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Side Option</td>\n<td>Description</td>\n<td>Price (USD)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Seasoned French Fries</td>\n<td>Crispy, golden</td>\n<td>$3.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Loaded Baked Potato</td>\n<td>Cheese, bacon, sour cream</td>\n<td>$4.49</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sweet Corn on the Cob</td>\n<td>Grilled, lightly buttered</td>\n<td>$3.99</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div>\n<hr />\n</div>\n<h2>Dessert</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2368\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2368\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2368\" src=\"/img/wp/cc1d64a358-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm.webp\" alt=\"Decadent Chocolate Stampede dessert with ice cream and a fresh Strawberry Shortcake with whipped cream.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/cc1d64a358-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm.webp 1024w, /img/wp/081156b4ec-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/cdcd1cebbe-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/ccf1c853ae-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-7.webp 768w, /img/wp/c37bfb46ac-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-5.webp 500w, /img/wp/37b67fc4c4-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2368\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Indulge in sweet endings like the rich Chocolate Stampede or a refreshing Strawberry Shortcake at Longhorn Steakhouse.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>End your meal with a dessert that hits the sweet spot.</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Dessert Name</td>\n<td>Description</td>\n<td>Price (USD)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chocolate Stampede</td>\n<td>Six kinds of chocolate, served with ice cream</td>\n<td>$8.49</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Strawberry Shortcake</td>\n<td>Fresh berries and whipped cream</td>\n<td>$6.99</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div>\n<hr />\n</div>\n<h2>Drinks: Beer, Wine &amp; Soft Options</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2370\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2370\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2370\" src=\"/img/wp/df8a715c94-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-1.webp\" alt=\"Assortment of drinks including a glass of beer, Blue Moon beer with an orange slice, red and white wine bottles and glasses, lemonade, raspberry iced tea, and a can of Coca-Cola with a glass of soda.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/df8a715c94-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-1.webp 1024w, /img/wp/d9390b649c-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-1.webp 300w, /img/wp/af0bd1c00b-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/fb4f6e77f0-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-1.webp 768w, /img/wp/231e7596cf-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-1.webp 500w, /img/wp/f0be271718-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2370\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Quench your thirst with a wide selection of beverages from Longhorn Steakhouse, including domestic and imported beers, fine wines, and various non-alcoholic options.</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>Beer</h3>\n<p>Longhorn offers both domestic and imported beer options to pair with any meal.</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Beer Brand</td>\n<td>Type</td>\n<td>Price (USD)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bud Light</td>\n<td>Domestic Lager</td>\n<td>$5.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blue Moon</td>\n<td>Belgian-Style Ale</td>\n<td>$6.50</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>Wine</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Wine Type</td>\n<td>Glass</td>\n<td>Bottle</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cabernet Sauvignon</td>\n<td>$8.00</td>\n<td>$30.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chardonnay</td>\n<td>$7.50</td>\n<td>$28.00</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>Non-Alcoholic Drinks</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Drink Option</td>\n<td>Price (USD)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Raspberry Iced Tea</td>\n<td>$2.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Classic Lemonade</td>\n<td>$2.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Soft Drinks (Coke, etc.)</td>\n<td>$2.79</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div>\n<hr />\n</div>\n<h2>Combo Meals</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2371\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2371\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2371\" src=\"/img/wp/8ed9db97fc-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-2.webp\" alt=\"Two sizzling combo meals: a Steak &amp; Shrimp Combo with rice, and a Chicken &amp; Ribs Combo with coleslaw, served in a warm restaurant setting.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/8ed9db97fc-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-2.webp 1024w, /img/wp/2da440c363-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-2.webp 300w, /img/wp/7abee91e72-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-2.webp 150w, /img/wp/41bd64b1e8-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-2.webp 768w, /img/wp/57788e0c84-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-2.webp 500w, /img/wp/dce85decca-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-2.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2371\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Enjoy the perfect pairing of flavors with Longhorn Steakhouse&#8217;s affordable combo meals, featuring options like Steak &amp; Shrimp or Chicken &amp; Ribs.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The combo meals are an affordable way to enjoy the Longhorn Steakhouse menu in a perfect pairing.</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Combo Type</td>\n<td>Items Included</td>\n<td>Price (USD)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Steak &amp; Shrimp Combo</td>\n<td>6 oz sirloin + grilled shrimp</td>\n<td>$19.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chicken &amp; Ribs Combo</td>\n<td>Parmesan chicken + BBQ ribs</td>\n<td>$18.49</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div>\n<hr />\n</div>\n<h2>Seasonal Favorites</h2>\n<p>Seasonal items rotate based on the season, featuring ingredients like strawberry, raspberry, or unique cuts of meat.</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Seasonal Dish</td>\n<td>Description</td>\n<td>Price (USD)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Strawberry Citrus Salad</td>\n<td>Fresh citrus with raspberry vinaigrette</td>\n<td>$13.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BBQ Pork Belly</td>\n<td>Slow smoke pork with tangy BBQ</td>\n<td>$15.99</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<hr />\n</div>\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-14\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"e5a2259e-b342-461c-8d37-78f15804d622\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light\">\n<pre><em data-is-last-node=\"\">Looking for a bold and upscale dining option? Discover the full <a href=\"/gordon-ramsay-hells-kitchen-menu-signature-dishes-prices-dining-experience-in-las-vegas-foxwoods/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">Gordon Ramsay Hell’s Kitchen menu</a> featuring signature dishes, prices, and the Hell’s Kitchen dining experience.</em></pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"aria-live=polite absolute\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-center\">\n<hr />\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n\n<h2>Allergen Information</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2373\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2373\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2373\" src=\"/img/wp/cb9dacacb6-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-4.webp\" alt=\"Hands holding a menu with an &quot;Allergen Information&quot; section, with a blurred waiter in the background.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/cb9dacacb6-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-4.webp 1024w, /img/wp/8eea9b42ea-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-4.webp 300w, /img/wp/8d33b0d235-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-4.webp 150w, /img/wp/1b246c5801-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-4.webp 768w, /img/wp/2dbec05e56-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-4.webp 500w, /img/wp/19bd6057e3-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-4.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2373\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Navigate your meal safely with Longhorn Steakhouse&#8217;s comprehensive allergen information, always available to help you make informed decisions.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>If you have allergen concerns, Longhorn Steakhouse provides guides to help you make safe decisions. Always check with your server.</p>\n<div>\n<hr />\n</div>\n<h2>Social Media &amp; Online Reviews</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2374\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2374\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2374\" src=\"/img/wp/ebaea936e2-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-5.webp\" alt=\"A smartphone displaying an Instagram post from @longhornsteaks featuring a grilled steak, and a tablet showing online reviews for Longhorn Steakhouse.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/ebaea936e2-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-5.webp 1024w, /img/wp/edb257a41a-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-5.webp 300w, /img/wp/dcdf29bbfe-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-5.webp 150w, /img/wp/38fe4698a9-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-5.webp 768w, /img/wp/bae4ec2208-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-5.webp 500w, /img/wp/a0dc410474-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-5.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2374\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Stay connected and see what others are saying about Longhorn Steakhouse on social media and review platforms like TripAdvisor.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Check out what others say on social media or platforms like <a>TripAdvisor</a>. You can often find the latest food menu reviews, specials, and real-time updates.</p>\n<div>\n<hr />\n</div>\n<h2>Final Thoughts: Eat Bold, Eat Longhorn</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2375\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2375\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2375\" src=\"/img/wp/68de24593b-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-6.webp\" alt=\"A sizzling grilled steak served with a fresh salad, french fries, a glass of beer, and a bottle and glass of red wine, embodying a complete Longhorn Steakhouse dining experience.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/68de24593b-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-6.webp 1024w, /img/wp/c9bc2b83ac-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-6.webp 300w, /img/wp/e6bb00c19f-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-6.webp 150w, /img/wp/a055038403-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-6.webp 768w, /img/wp/b88603be5f-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-6.webp 500w, /img/wp/2d8c36f060-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-07pm-6.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2375\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Experience the robust flavors and hearty meals that make Longhorn Steakhouse a favorite for lovers of bold American food.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>With its signature flavors, hearty meals, and grilled to perfection meats, Longhorn Steakhouse continues to serve as a favorite for lovers of robust American food. Whether you&#8217;re trying the 22 oz bone-in ribeye or a light salad, this menu has options to satisfy any craving.</p>\n<p>Enjoy your visit. Just remember: if you see &#8220;access denied,&#8221; come back here for permission to access the most flavorful server around.</p>\n<h2><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong>LongHorn Steakhouse Important Links</strong></span></h2>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_16hzy_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" style=\"width: 27.8154%;\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th data-col-size=\"sm\">Platform</th>\n<th data-col-size=\"m